    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39138" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίδειπν-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>containing an integer and
				one-tenth</i>: hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. λόγος</span>
			ratio <i>of</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i> : <i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>, lamb.<i><span class="en">
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.54P.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>one in ten</i>:
			hence Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δέκατον, τό</span>, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>.
				<i>tenth, tithe</i>, Lex ap.<i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.7.10
			</span></i>, Lex ap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				43.71
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τόκοι</span> interest <i>of</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>%, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.377
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1411a17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1346b32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>payment
				of</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>% <i>on account,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11.161<i>A</i>79
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>payment of</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>% as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακαταβολή</span> (q.v.), ib.<i><span class="en">
				5(2).357
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Stymphalus</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHal.</u>
				1.63
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδικία ἄνευ ἐπιδεκάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				640
			</span></i> (Peparethus, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>. <i>additional, extra payment of
			onetenth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.32.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.33.32
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>.</div>
